flowchart TB
accTitle: Approval rules and execution schedule meet at the patch task
accDescr: Corporate patch policy becomes a baseline. The maintenance window runs the patch document on managed nodes and produces compliance results.
 Policy[Corporate approved patches] -->|translate by operating system| Base[Patch Manager baseline]
 Window[Weekly maintenance window] -->|targets, cutoff, concurrency| Task[AWS-RunPatchBaseline]
 Base -->|approved patch set| Task
 Task --> Nodes[Managed EC2 nodes with SSM Agent]
 Repo[Package repositories] -->|download approved updates| Nodes
 Nodes --> Report[Patch compliance results]
